@startuml fig5-1-sequence
' ===== 统一黑白打印样式：白底 / 黑框 / 黑字 / 无阴影 =====
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBorderColor #000000
  ParticipantFontColor #000000
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  LifeLineBorderColor #000000
  ArrowColor #000000
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ActorBorderColor #000000
  ActorFontColor #000000
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #000000
  GroupFontColor #000000
  DividerBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DividerBorderColor #000000
  DividerFontColor #000000
  DelayBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DelayBorderColor #000000
  ReferenceBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ReferenceBorderColor #000000
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
  FontColor #000000
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
  FontColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
  FontColor #000000
}

actor "成员 A\n浏览器" as A
participant "JwtAuthFilter\n(安全过滤器链)" as jwt
participant "MessageController" as ctrl
participant "MessageService" as ms
participant "ChannelAccessService\n(权限引擎)" as cas
database "MessageRepository\n(JPA / 事务)" as repo
participant "GatewayWebSocketHandler" as gw
actor "成员 B\n浏览器" as B

A -> jwt : 1: POST /api/channels/{channelId}/messages\n(Authorization: Bearer JWT)
jwt -> ctrl : 2: 验签通过，注入 Authentication(userId)
ctrl -> ms : 3: createMessage(channelId, dto, authorId)
ms -> cas : 4: requireSendMessages(channelId, authorId)
cas --> ms : 5: 校验通过（否则抛 403）
ms -> repo : 6: save(message)\n事务提交
repo --> ms : 已落库的 Message
ms --> ctrl : 7: 返回 Message
note over ctrl, gw
  事务提交之后才广播，避免"消息未落库就被推送"
end note
ctrl -> gw : 8: dispatchToGuild(guildId, MESSAGE_CREATE, payload)\n→ dispatchChannelEvent → dispatchMessage
gw -> B : 9: Dispatch 帧 (OP0 MESSAGE_CREATE)
note right of gw
  broadcast 按 guild 成员过滤后下发：
  仅 session.status=READY 且 guildIds 含该公会的会话
end note
ctrl --> A : 10: 200 OK\n(message JSON)
A -> A : 乐观消息标记为已确认
B -> B : 更新消息列表，界面即时渲染新消息
@enduml
